#ASSERT (`reference: First Schedule item 4(א) to section 7`)'s `the target is` EQUALS `section 7 of the Law as it reads now: repealed, so that the section prints no text`
#ASSERT (`reference: 1986 regulation 1 to section 12`)'s `the citing words say it points at` EQUALS `section 12 of the Law as the citing words take it: the book called פנקס of databases`
