§ `Tests of the documented fork of the Interpretation Law section 25`

-- Reading A of P3(b): read through section 25, the citing words reach section 12 as it now reads. The row records the reading and does not rule on it (fork P3 in NOTES.md).
#ASSERT `the reading through the Interpretation Law section 25 reaches` (`reference: 1986 regulation 1 to section 12`) EQUALS JUST `section 12 of the Law as it reads now: the register called מרשם of databases, kept by ראש הרשות`
-- Reading A of P5: read through section 25, the citing words reach the definition whose paragraph (12) names regulation 7 (fork P5 in NOTES.md).
#ASSERT `the reading through the Interpretation Law section 25 reaches` (`reference: 2023 regulation 7 to section 7`) EQUALS JUST `the definition of מידע בעל רגישות מיוחדת in section 3 of the Law, whose paragraph (12) the Second Schedule sets out, and which names regulation 7 of the 2023 regulations`
-- The row does not say what section 25 does for the others: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `the reading through the Interpretation Law section 25 reaches` (`reference: First Schedule item 4(א) to section 7`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the reading through the Interpretation Law section 25 reaches` (`reference: 1986 regulation 1 to section 7`) EQUALS NOTHING
